ach tree"],"synset":"oewn-12668806-n"}]}],"Prunus persica nectarina":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_persica_nectarina-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"variety or mutation of the peach bearing fruit with smooth skin and (usually) yellow flesh","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["nectarine","nectarine tree"],"synset":"oewn-12668957-n"}]}],"Prunus pumila":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_pumila-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"small straggling American cherry growing on sandy soil and having minute scarcely edible purplish-black fruit","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["sand cherry","Prunus pumilla susquehanae","Prunus susquehanae","Prunus cuneata"],"synset":"oewn-12669185-n"}]}],"Prunus pumilla susquehanae":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_pumilla_susquehanae-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"small straggling American cherry growing on sandy soil and having minute scarcely edible purplish-black fruit","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["sand cherry","Prunus pumila","Prunus susquehanae","Prunus cuneata"],"synset":"oewn-12669185-n"}]}],"Prunus salicina":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_salicina-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"small tree of China and Japan bearing large yellow to red plums usually somewhat inferior to European plums in flavor","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["Japanese plum"],"synset":"oewn-12669454-n"}]}],"Prunus serotina":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_serotina-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"large North American wild cherry with round black sour edible fruit","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["black cherry","black cherry tree","rum cherry"],"synset":"oewn-12669649-n"}]}],"Prunus serrulata":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_serrulata-n","pos":"noun","pos_tag":"n","senses":[{"definition":"ornamental tree with inedible fruits widely cultivated in many varieties for its white blossoms","pos_tag":"n","synonyms":["oriental cherry","Japanese cherry","Japanese flowering cherry"],"synset":"oewn-12670078-n"}]}],"Prunus sieboldii":[{"id":"oewn-Prunus_sieboldii-n","po